## ====================================================================
## Parcel Builder - Standard .gitignore
## Excludes build outputs, local IDE configs, OS files, and cache
## Preserves project source files and the final AddInPackage output (.esriAddinX)
## ====================================================================

# Build & Compilation outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio & IDE local caches
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.userprefs
*.usertasks
*.suo
*.sln.docstates
*.DotSettings.user

# AI & Agent local caches
.agents/
.gemini/
scratch/

# Test Results & Code Coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# NuGet & Package caches
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
packages/
project.lock.json

# ArcGIS Pro runtime locks & temp files
*.lock
*.sr.lock
*.tmp
*.temp

# OS generated files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# Windows crash dumps & crash logs
*.dmp
*.crash

# Keep the final distribution Add-in package (.esriAddinX)
!AddInPackage/
!AddInPackage/ParcelBuilder.esriAddinX
